<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><font face="arial">To&nbsp;{!advpm__Matter__c.advpm__Primary_Contact__c}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></p><p style="margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p style="margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><font face="arial">Your loan with&nbsp;{!advpm__Matter__c.Originating_Lender__c}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">&nbsp;has recently charged off due to non-payment and has been sent to us, the legal department for review. The amount due on the loan is&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">{!advpm__Matter__c.Outstanding_Balance__c}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">. We understand that we are all going through uncertain times right now and therefore wanted to reach out to see if you were interested in working out some sort of payment resolution without having to go the litigation route.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><font face="arial">Please feel free to call and/or email us to discuss further.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p style="margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p style="margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><div style=""><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!advpm__Matter__c.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>